{"product_id":"x-engineering-the-corporation-reinventing-your-business-in-the-digital-age","title":"X-Engineering the Corporation: Reinventing Your Business in the Digital Age","description":"\u003cp\u003eJames Champy's 'New York Times' bestseller 'Reengineering the Corporation' ignited a revolution inside businesses in the 1990s. Now Champy shows managers how to cross ('x') new boundaries. Here is the new corporation - a web of interacting processes and people without walls between customers, suppliers, or even competitors. It is an environment of free-flowing information and ideas where businesses learn to become more transparent, harmonize their processes with others, and standardize their process and technology so that they can focus on real innovation. 'X-engineering' provides the next opportunity for business performance improvement and reveals the real benefits of information technology and the Internet.\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: James Champy\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780446678971\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 240\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 163 x 213\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.in","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41750660939929,"sku":"3RB9780446678971","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/x-engineering-the-corporation-reinventing-your-business-in-the-digital-age-263549.jpg?v=1694792824","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/x-engineering-the-corporation-reinventing-your-business-in-the-digital-age","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}